    "title_en": "Virtual intervention reduces substance use in American Indians and Alaska Natives",
    "sub": "Emerging adults who participated in workshops combining evidence-based interventions and traditional practices reported reduced cannabis, alcohol use, and anxiety.",
    "sub_pt": "Emerging adults who participated in workshops combining evidence-based interventions and traditional practices reported reduced cannabis, alcohol use, and anxiety.",
